{center}{arialbld}The Tekton Fortress{arial}

You are about to participate in the greatest allied operation ever against the war machine of dictator Archduke {arialbld}Magnus von Tekton{arial}.{pause}

For three years the Tekton plague has spread over the entire old Eustral continent, crushing the conquered nations under a military boot.{pause}

It started with {arialbld}Polkland{arial}, invaded in the first hours of a lightning war. The Polkash cavalry could only gather a symbolic resistance against the Psychos armours.{pause}

Then it was {arialbld}Fromance{arial}, which fell in six weeks - despite the "Imagino" line, a barrier of bunkers established along the Tekton border, said insurmountable. The Psychos simply bypassed this obstacle, done while invading the {arialbld}Duchy of Kurtember{arial} and {arialbld}Zwalonia.{arial}{pause}

Only the insular land of {arialbld}Normland{arial} could escape from this invasion. At the cost of fierce combat, on sea and air, the Normos have heroically succeeded in checking Psycho power.{pause}

Deprived of total victory, the frustration of the tyrannical megalomaniac Magnus von Tekton turned to ungovernable fury. A single idea has since consumed his mind: the total destruction of the Normo nation.

To this deadly end, Magnus has invested a colossal budget in research for developing an absolute weapon that would reduce Normland to ashes...{pause}


We don't know the extent of their research, but we must act now before it's too late.{pause}

The Normo Prime Minister, {arialbld}Weston Lacoline{arial}, is resolute to be finished with the Tekton dictator. "Somebody has to go after this raving madman".{pause}

With the help of our powerful Schyzo allies an ambitious plan has been conceived...

{arialbld}OPERATION GAME-OVER{arial}{}
